<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Omega in talks, issues cautionary.</title>
<headline>Omega in talks, issues cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Omega Holdings Ltd said on Thursday that it had entered into negotiations which, if successfully concluded, may have an effect on its share price.</p>
<p>Omega urged its shareholders to exercise caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
